{"schema_version": 1, "segment_epoch": 1791968700, "covers_from": "2026-10-14T09:05:00+00:00", "covers_to": "2026-10-14T09:06:00+00:00", "next_epoch": 1791968760, "schedule": [{"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:05:00+00:00", "duration_seconds": 15, "queue_number": 64161, "sprite_key": "leopardcat_oldtown", "district": "zhongzheng", "topic": "環境", "content": "停車空間一直都是北市很大的問題，我本身是在紀州庵旁住戶，覺得住家旁汽車臨停空間真的少的可憐，謝謝", "display_name": "中正代表 No.64,161", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:05:15+00:00", "duration_seconds": 11, "queue_number": 64162, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "district": "daan", "topic": "交通", "content": "台北市的停車格大多都太窄了，沒考慮到停完車後可以開門下車的距離。", "display_name": "大安代表 No.64,162", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:05:26+00:00", "duration_seconds": 14, "queue_number": 64163, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "district": "zhongshan", "topic": "育兒", "content": "北漂的準單親媽媽，無法入籍台北只能讓小孩就讀私立幼稚園，高額的學費，無法喘息的育兒快被壓垮", "display_name": "中山代表 No.64,163", "mood": "worried", "is_replay": false}, {"starts_at": "2026-10-14T09:05:40+00:00", "duration_seconds": 20, "type": "padding", "queue_number": 34452, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "district": "neihu", "topic": "城市修繕", "content": "都更案遙遙無期，我住的公寓都50年了，沒有電梯，都不知未來如何爬上五樓的住家，可否請市長加快速度都更", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.34,452", "mood": "helpless", "is_replay": true}], "queue": [{"position": 1, "queue_number": 64162, "sprite_key": "squirrel_culture", "display_name": "大安代表 No.64,162", "district": "daan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 2, "queue_number": 64163, "sprite_key": "penguin_culture", "display_name": "中山代表 No.64,163", "district": "zhongshan", "is_replay": false, "frozen": true}, {"position": 3, "queue_number": 34452, "sprite_key": "beaver_business", "display_name": "內湖代表 No.34,452", "district": "neihu", "is_replay": true, "frozen": true}, {"position": 4, "queue_number": 19723, "sprite_key": "deer_oldtown", "display_name": "中正代表 No.19,723", "district": "z